# Signalstack Rock (CIPlay signalstack_rock): the shelf, the relay log, the Receiver's plans (relay desk), the mast top,
# the antenna's plans (mast box), the fourth fragment. The shelf's stores chest has pine seeds.
island Signalstack Rock
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Fragments
zone shelf
expect step 1
read Relay log: fragments
expect step 2
open Relay desk
wait 3
expect step 3
open Relay stores
wait 2
expect item Seed_Pine 2
walk 6 -10 to 8.5 -6 to 8.5 -2 to 7.5 1.5 to 6 4.5 to 3.5 5 to 1 3 h=9
zone mast_top
expect step 4
# REDO 10-24: the mast box is in the ice until the three guy clamps are on the winch
expect hidden mastbox
use mastwinch
expect story mastfixed 0
open Ledge chest
open Drift chest
wait 2
expect story clamp 3
expect step 5
use mastwinch
expect story clamp 0
expect shown mastbox
expect step 6
open Mast box
wait 3
expect step 7
read Fragment 4
expect done
